<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n81076" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιαμπέχω</span></b>  (also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιαμπίσχω</span></b> 
		<i><span class="en">
			Ph.
			1.369
		</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
			Philostr.
			<u>Im.</u>
			2.26
		</span></i> (cf. <i><span class="en">
			11
		</span></i>)), -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ήμπεσχον</span>
		<i><span class="en">
			Ar.
			<u>Eq.</u>
			893
		</span></i> :—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>put round
				about</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τινά τι</span>
			<i>put</i> a thing <i>round</i> or <i>over</i> one, Ar.l.c.:—
				Med.
			, <i>put around oneself, put on</i>, metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀνόματα καὶ ῥήματα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Smp.</u>
					221e
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>cover all over</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὀστᾶ μετὰ τῶν σαρκῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phd.</u>
					98d
				</span></i>
			; later <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περιαμπίσχω τί τινι</span>
			Ph.l.c.: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ πράγματα γυμνὰ ἐξέκειτο καὶ οὐ
					περιήμπισχεν αὐτὰ ἡ λέξις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>VS</u>
					2.22
				</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
